#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid "&showfoto; Configuration"
msgstr "&showfoto; Podešavanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&showfoto; tries to give you as much control on how it works as possible. "
"There are many options that change the behavior of &showfoto;. To access "
"these settings select <menuchoice><guimenu>Setting</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Configure &showfoto;</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the Menu "
"Bar. The configuration dialog is separated into eight pages. You can change "
"between these pages by clicking on the icons on the left-hand side of the "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"&showfoto; pokušava da vam omogući što više kontrole njegovog rada. Postoji "
"mnogo opcija koje mogu promijeniti ponašanje &showfoto;. Za pristup ovim "
"postavkama odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Podesi &showfoto;</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz Menija. Dijalog "
"za podešavanje je podijeljen na osam stranica. Možete se pomjerati među "
"stranicama korištenjem ikona na lijevoj strani okvira."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Configuration Dialog"
msgstr "Okvir za podešavanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Interface Options</guilabel> section is rather self-"
"explanatory."
msgstr "<guilabel>Opcije okruženja</guilabel> odjeljak je jasan sam po sebi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Exposure Indicators</guilabel> lets one choose the color to "
"use when the under- respectively over-exposure indicators are selected. "
"Preferentially the colors should be contrasting with what they indicate, "
"that is, under-exposure should have a light color and over-exposure areas "
"should show dark colors."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Prikaz izlaganja</guilabel> dozvoljava da se odabere boja kada su "
"respektivni indikatori odabrani. Boje prvenstveno trebaju biti u kontrastu s "
"onim što pokazuju to jest, ne izložena područja trebaju imati svijetlu boju, "
"a izložena tamnu."

